---
/* Our Vision (the rebuild brief, page 5): the long-term ambition, told the way the brief's
   storytelling principles ask: the world first, the root problem, what changes, the cost of not
   solving it, the stepping stones, and people before money. Ambitions are worded as ambitions. */
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";
import CtaBand from "../components/ui/CtaBand.astro";
import { routes } from "../config/site";

const changes = [
  { before: "Hire a researcher", after: "A Research Worker studies the market with you" },
  { before: "Hire a product team", after: "A Product Worker turns evidence into plans" },
  { before: "Hire marketing and sales", after: "Workers help you reach customers" },
  { before: "Hire operations and finance", after: "Workers keep the business running" },
];
---

<Page
  title="Our Vision — SoloFactory AI"
  description="Imagine a world where anyone can own a company that pays them. Why entrepreneurship is still so hard, what changes when intelligence and execution become accessible, and our ambition to help one million people build sustainable businesses."
>
  <section class="vhero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our vision</p>
      <h1 class="vhero__title" id="page-title">
        Imagine a world where anyone can own a company <span class="soft">that pays them.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="vhero__lines">
        <span>With or without a job.</span>
        <span>With or without a team.</span>
        <span>With the leverage of AI.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="lead vhero__lead">
        So everyone has the freedom to spend more time living the life they love.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="hard-title">
    <div class="container two-col">
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">Why it is still so hard</p>
        <h2 class="h2" id="hard-title">The idea is rarely the problem.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="prose" data-reveal>
        <p>
          Ideas are everywhere. So is ambition. What is missing is everything in between: the
          research, the product, the marketing, the sales, the operations, the finances.
        </p>
        <p>
          Until now, every one of those capabilities meant hiring someone, so the team had to exist
          before the business could earn. <strong>Business capability has been locked behind
          hiring</strong>, and only people with capital, connections or a safety net could reach it.
        </p>
        <p>
          And when it stays that way, the cost is real. Savings run out. Families carry the risk.
          Good ideas that would have helped people are never built.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt" aria-labelledby="change-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">What changes</p>
        <h2 class="h2" id="change-title">When intelligence and execution become accessible.</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          AI can now do real work, not just answer questions. Connect it to one understanding of a
          business, keep a person in charge, and a single entrepreneur can reach capabilities that
          used to need a team.
        </p>
      </div>
      <ul class="changes" data-reveal aria-label="From hiring to a workforce">
        {changes.map((c) => (
          <li>
            <span class="changes__before">{c.before}</span>
            <span class="changes__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            <span class="changes__after">{c.after}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
      <p class="changes__note" data-reveal>
        The Research and Product Workers are in early access today. The others are planned.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="future-title">
    <div class="container two-col">
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">The entrepreneur of the future</p>
        <h2 class="h2" id="future-title">One entrepreneur. One connected Brain. An entire AI workforce.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="prose" data-reveal>
        <p>
          The entrepreneur of the future brings what only a person can: the ambition, the ideas,
          the judgement, the decisions and the responsibility.
        </p>
        <p>
          SoloFactory brings the connected intelligence, the memory of the business and a
          workforce that turns decisions into action.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>We want to make it possible for anyone in the world to become an entrepreneur,
          regardless of their access to capital, expertise or a traditional team.</strong>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt" aria-labelledby="million-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">Our measurable ambition</p>
        <h2 class="million" id="million-title">
          <span>One million people</span>
          <span class="soft">building sustainable businesses.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="two-col">
        <div class="prose" data-reveal>
          <p>
            Not simply more companies. More people with something of their own. More useful
            products and services. More livelihoods, and more value for the communities around
            them.
          </p>
          <p class="fine">An ambition, not a result we can promise.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="prose" data-reveal>
          <p><strong>A sustainable business, the way we mean it:</strong></p>
          <p>
            It pays its way. It serves its customers well. It does not depend on endless funding or
            a team the founder cannot afford. It lasts.
          </p>
          <p>
            We would rather help a million people build businesses like that than help a few build
            something that burns out.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="invite-title">
    <div class="container container--narrow invite" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">An invitation</p>
      <h2 class="h2" id="invite-title">Build this future with us.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        If you have always wanted to build something of your own, you are who we are building for.
        Join early access, tell us what you are building, and help shape what SoloFactory becomes.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand track="cta_vision" secondary={{ href: routes.about, label: "Read our story" }} />
</Page>

<style>
  .vhero {
    padding: clamp(56px, 8vw, 120px) 0 clamp(56px, 7vw, 104px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .vhero__title {
    max-width: 17ch;
    font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 96px);
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }

  .vhero__lines {
    display: grid;
    gap: 4px;
    margin-top: 40px;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.4vw, 30px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .vhero__lead {
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .two-col {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .changes {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--border);
  }

  .changes li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 40px minmax(0, 1.3fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    background: var(--bg);
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  .changes__before {
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    text-decoration: line-through;
    text-decoration-color: var(--border-strong);
  }

  .changes__arrow {
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .changes__after {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .changes__note {
    margin-top: 16px;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .million {
    display: grid;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 80px);
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .fine {
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .invite {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .invite .h2 {
    margin: 0 auto 20px;
  }

  .invite .lead {
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .two-col {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .changes li {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .changes__arrow {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
